      { question: "Is the work of the Civil Rights Movement finished?", answer: "No — while landmark laws were achieved, racial inequality persists and the pursuit of justice continues today", options: ["Yes — all goals were fully achieved", "No — while landmark laws were achieved, racial inequality persists and the pursuit of justice continues today", "The movement was unsuccessful", "Only voting rights were achieved"] }
